    "# PFZ ML-Based Prediction for Bay of Bengal\n",
    "## Complete Colab Workflow (2024-01 to 2026-09 Training → 2026-10-04 & 2026-10-05 Prediction)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook:\n",
    "1. Sets up ERA5 and Copernicus credentials\n",
    "2. Downloads historical data (2024-Jan to 2026-Sep)\n",
    "3. Trains ML models (Random Forest + Gradient Boosting)\n",
    "4. Predicts PFZ for Oct 4-5, 2026\n",
    "5. Plots results with thermal fronts and currents"
   ]
